-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
# FIDO Alliance Metadata Service ROOT certificate.
#
# Bundled here so `webauthn-mds-verify.js` has a trust anchor without an
# extra ops step. Ops teams that pin a different trust anchor (self-hosted
# MDS mirror, corporate CA relay) override via WINGCASTER_FIDO_MDS_ROOT_PEM.
#
# The current FIDO Alliance MDS3 BLOB is signed by a chain that roots at
# GlobalSign R3 (fetch from https://valid.mds.fidoalliance.org/ and pin
# the correct root cert here before deploying to production).
#
# This placeholder file lives in git so tests can find it, but production
# MUST replace it with the actual PEM. `loadFidoMdsRootPem()` logs an
# error when the file is missing / empty and the verifier refuses every
# BLOB — fail-closed, which is the right posture for a trust anchor.
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
